ataBoundary\\"]\\nd:[\\"$\\",\\"div\\",null,\{\\"hidden\\":true,\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"$L10\\",null,\{\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"$9\\",null,\{\\"name\\":\\"Next.Metadata\\",\\"children\\":\\"$L11\\"\}]\}]\}]\\ne:[\\"$\\",\\"meta\\",null,\{\\"name\\":\\"next-size-adjust\\",\\"content\\":\\"\\"\}]\\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"12:I[2874,[\\"/_next/static/chunks/7f0fbfeda9ee6f4b.js\\",\\"/_next/static/chunks/a3b2d096bc1056dc.js\\"],\\"Navbar\\"]\\n13:I[5500,[\\"/_next/static/chunks/7f0fbfeda9ee6f4b.js\\",\\"/_next/static/chunks/a3b2d096bc1056dc.js\\"],\\"Image\\"]\\n14:Tc48,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\\u003ch2\\u003eMeet Your Instructor\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eI'm Jonathan, founder of Growth Pair and your guide through this Claude course. My background spans growth roles at major B2C tech companies like Uber and Coinbase during my San Francisco days. These days, I'm completely obsessed with AI tools \'97 spending dozens of hours weekly exploring everything from GPT to Gemini, and especially Claude's latest features.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThis course exists because I believe Claude can transform how marketers work. Not through theoretical concepts, but practical applications you can implement immediately.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat You'll Master in This Course\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThis program focuses on making you a 10x marketer using Claude's two most powerful tools: Claude.ai (their chat interface) and Claude Artifacts (for building interactive content and apps).\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eHere's what we'll cover:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSetting up Claude.ai for marketing workflows\\u003c/strong\\u003e \'97 Beyond basic prompts to advanced conversation strategies\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSpecific marketing use cases\\u003c/strong\\u003e \'97 Content creation, campaign planning, audience research, and competitive analysis\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eClaude Artifacts fundamentals\\u003c/strong\\u003e \'97 Understanding the technical capabilities without needing to code\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBuilding your first marketing web app\\u003c/strong\\u003e \'97 A hands-on project that demonstrates Claude's real potential\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe goal is simple: by the end of these lessons, you should be able to accomplish 10x what you could yesterday.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eHow This Course Works\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eTwo important things to know upfront:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThis isn't scripted content.\\u003c/strong\\u003e Every lesson is a live demonstration showing real workflows and best practices. You'll see actual prompts, real responses, and genuine problem-solving in action. This means you get authentic insights into how experienced marketers actually use Claude.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAI evolves fast.\\u003c/strong\\u003e The Claude ecosystem changes constantly. While the core principles in this course will remain valuable, specific features or interfaces might look different by the time you're watching. Don't let that stop you \'97 the fundamental approaches translate across updates.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eGetting the Most from These Lessons\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eEach lesson is designed to be interactive. Don't just watch and absorb \'97 follow along with your own Claude account. Test the prompts, experiment with variations, and adapt the examples to your specific marketing challenges.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe real learning happens when you start applying these techniques to your actual work.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eKey Takeaways\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eClaude can genuinely transform marketing productivity when used strategically, not just for basic content generation\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThis course emphasizes hands-on practice over theory \'97 you'll build real marketing assets\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe content is unscripted and practical, showing authentic workflows from an experienced growth marketer\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAI tools evolve rapidly, but mastering core principles gives you a foundation that adapts to changes\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eInteractive learning works best \'97 plan to follow along with your own Claude account\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7:[[\\"$\\",\\"$L12\\",null,\{\}],[\\"$\\",\\"main\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"min-h-screen pt-24 pb-20 px-6\\",\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"article\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\\",\\"children\\":[[\\"$\\",\\"nav\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"mb-8\\",\\"children\\":[[\\"$\\",\\"$L5\\",null,\{\\"href\\":\\"/courses\\",\\"className\\":\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors\\",\\"children\\":\\"
