 to watch the video, track your progress, and unlock all course modules.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium bg-accent text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors" href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.claudemarketers.com/login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 /login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-1}}"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>Sign up free &amp; watch</a></div></div></div><div class="space-y-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-xl [&amp;&gt;h2]:font-bold [&amp;&gt;h2]:mt-10 [&amp;&gt;h2]:mb-3 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-lg [&amp;&gt;h3]:font-semibold [&amp;&gt;h3]:mt-7 [&amp;&gt;h3]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ol]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:list-decimal [&amp;&gt;ol&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:text-accent [&amp;_code]:bg-accent/5 [&amp;_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:text-[13px] [&amp;_a]:text-accent [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-accent-hover"><h2>Why Claude Desktop App Makes All the Difference</h2>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Before diving into setup, let's address the platform question. While Claude works across mobile and web, the desktop app delivers the cleanest experience for marketing workflows. This guide uses Claude Pro on the Mac desktop app, but the principles apply regardless of your platform.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>The goal here is simple: transform Claude from a basic chatbot into a high-leverage marketing assistant that knows your business, connects to your tools, and maintains context across all your work.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h2>Essential Settings: Memory and Capabilities</h2>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Your first stop is the settings pane, specifically the <strong>Capabilities</strong> section. Two memory settings here will dramatically improve Claude's performance:</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <ul>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <li><strong>Conversation Memory</strong>: Allows Claude to reference previous chats</li>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <li><strong>Cross-Conversation Memory</strong>: Enables learning across all interactions</li>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 </ul>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Both settings are optional, but they're game-changers for marketing work. Claude becomes exponentially smarter about your preferences, projects, and communication style when these are enabled.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h3>Importing Memory from Other AI Tools</h3>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth26075\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Switching from ChatGPT or another AI assistant? Claude provides a specific prompt you can copy and paste into your previous tool. That tool will output a summary of your chat history, preferences, and context, which you can then import directly into Claude.</p>\cell \row

