p for free to watch the video, track your progress, and unlock all course modules.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium bg-accent text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors" href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.claudemarketers.com/login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-2"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 /login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-2}}"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>Sign up free &amp; watch</a></div></div></div><div class="space-y-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-xl [&amp;&gt;h2]:font-bold [&amp;&gt;h2]:mt-10 [&amp;&gt;h2]:mb-3 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-lg [&amp;&gt;h3]:font-semibold [&amp;&gt;h3]:mt-7 [&amp;&gt;h3]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ol]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:list-decimal [&amp;&gt;ol&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:text-accent [&amp;_code]:bg-accent/5 [&amp;_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:text-[13px] [&amp;_a]:text-accent [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-accent-hover"><h2>Getting Started: The Power of Parallel Workflows</h2>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Claude Cowork transforms how marketers handle their daily tasks by letting you run multiple AI-powered workflows simultaneously. Instead of manually slogging through competitive research, content creation, and market analysis one task at a time, you can orchestrate multiple AI agents working in parallel \'97 essentially becoming a conductor of your own marketing automation orchestra.</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>This walkthrough covers three core marketing workflows: creating lead magnets, competitive analysis, and content research. More importantly, you'll see how to run these simultaneously and even schedule them to run automatically.</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h2>Setting Up Your First Three Workflows</h2>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Let's jump straight into building three different workflows that showcase Cowork's versatility. Each handles a different marketing function, and you'll run them all at the same time.</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h3>Workflow 1: PDF Lead Magnet Creation</h3>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Start with a simple but powerful prompt for your first task:</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>"Create a PDF guide on the best practices for using Claude Cowork for marketers. Keep this very concise and only three pages with a very minimalistic look. Export this in a PDF format that I can view on my desktop."</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>This workflow demonstrates Claude's ability to not just generate content, but format and export it in the exact deliverable format you need. The key here is being specific about length, design aesthetic, and output format.</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h3>Workflow 2: Competitive Intelligence</h3>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Launch your second task while the first is running. For this example, we'll analyze a cold plunge company called Nordic Wave:</p>\nestcell \nestrow

\itap2\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
