to watch the video, track your progress, and unlock all course modules.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium bg-accent text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors" href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.claudemarketers.com/login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-3"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 /login?callbackUrl=/dashboard/lessons/cw-3}}"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>Sign up free &amp; watch</a></div></div></div><div class="space-y-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-xl [&amp;&gt;h2]:font-bold [&amp;&gt;h2]:mt-10 [&amp;&gt;h2]:mb-3 [&amp;&gt;h2]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-lg [&amp;&gt;h3]:font-semibold [&amp;&gt;h3]:mt-7 [&amp;&gt;h3]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;h3]:text-foreground [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:mb-4 [&amp;&gt;ol]:pl-5 [&amp;&gt;ol]:list-decimal [&amp;&gt;ol&gt;li]:mb-1.5 [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:text-accent [&amp;_code]:bg-accent/5 [&amp;_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:text-[13px] [&amp;_a]:text-accent [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-accent-hover"><h2>The Marketing Renaissance: Why AI Changes Everything for Paid Marketers</h2>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>As a career marketer, I'm seeing something remarkable happen: the traditional silos between marketing specialties are crumbling. We're witnessing the rise of the "growth engineer" \'97 versatile marketers who can jump between paid ads, email marketing, content creation, and analytics with equal confidence.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>The secret weapon? AI augmentation through Claude. If you're a paid marketer who's always felt intimidated by email marketing, or a content marketer who avoided Google Ads, those days are over. Claude can fill your knowledge gaps and help you execute campaigns across channels you've never touched before.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Let's dive into how Claude's Cowork feature transforms paid marketing workflows, using real examples and live account data.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h2>Setting Up Parallel Campaign Analysis</h2>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>The power of Claude Cowork lies in its ability to handle multiple complex tasks simultaneously. Instead of jumping between tools and losing context, you can run comprehensive campaign analysis across all your channels at once.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Here's the three-pronged approach that works consistently well:</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p><strong>1. Creative Ideation for New Channels</strong> Start by feeding Claude your website URL and asking for creative angles based on your value propositions. For example: "Given our website, give me creative ideas and angles based on our value props that we can use for Meta and TikTok ads."</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p><strong>2. Performance Analysis</strong> While that's running, kick off a performance review by sharing your campaign data: "Give me an analysis on the data from our performance over the last handful of months that's in this Google Sheet."</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p><strong>3. Account Auditing</strong> Finally, request a comprehensive audit: "Run an audit on my entire Google Ads account and provide suggestions on what I should be doing and low lift items I can implement right away."</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth16111\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <h2>Troubleshooting Real-World Issues</h2>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
