\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p><strong>From review analysis:</strong> Build a direct attack strategy based on competitor weaknesses. Create comparison pages, ad campaigns, and sales materials that specifically address the pain points their customers experience.</p>\cell \row

