\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <p>Don't try to process everything immediately. Let the tasks run in the background while you handle other work. Check results after lunch when you have time to properly analyze and act on the insights.</p>\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
