ataBoundary\\"]\\nd:[\\"$\\",\\"div\\",null,\{\\"hidden\\":true,\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"$L10\\",null,\{\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"$9\\",null,\{\\"name\\":\\"Next.Metadata\\",\\"children\\":\\"$L11\\"\}]\}]\}]\\ne:[\\"$\\",\\"meta\\",null,\{\\"name\\":\\"next-size-adjust\\",\\"content\\":\\"\\"\}]\\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"12:I[2874,[\\"/_next/static/chunks/7f0fbfeda9ee6f4b.js\\",\\"/_next/static/chunks/a3b2d096bc1056dc.js\\"],\\"Navbar\\"]\\n13:I[5500,[\\"/_next/static/chunks/7f0fbfeda9ee6f4b.js\\",\\"/_next/static/chunks/a3b2d096bc1056dc.js\\"],\\"Image\\"]\\n14:T1563,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat Are Skills in Claude?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSkills in Claude are reusable prompts that give the AI deep expertise in specific areas you work with regularly. Think of them as hiring a specialist consultant who's always available with the best practices from industry leaders.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eInstead of researching best practices every time you need to create performance ads or email campaigns, you can create a skill that contains all the methodologies from top practitioners in that field. Claude then automatically applies this expertise whenever you work on related tasks.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eHow Skills Work Behind the Scenes\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSkills are stored as markdown files (.md) in a designated folder on your system. When you mention certain trigger words or work on specific tasks, Claude automatically pulls in the relevant skill to inform its responses.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe real power comes from Claude's ability to create these skills for you. Rather than manually researching and writing up best practices yourself, you can ask Claude to research industry leaders and create comprehensive skills based on their methodologies.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eCreating Your First Skill: A Performance Marketing Example\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eLet's walk through creating a performance marketing skill that draws from the expertise of top practitioners in the field.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eStep 1: Request the Skill Creation\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAsk Claude to create a skill for your specific needs. For example:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\"I'm a marketer that's constantly running performance ads on Meta and paid social in general. Create a skill that leverages insights from the very best performance marketers and their methodologies. Create that skill and add it into our folder.\\"\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eStep 2: Answer Clarifying Questions\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eClaude will typically ask follow-up questions to make the skill more targeted:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWhat platforms should the skill focus on?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWhat's the primary goal (lead generation, sales, awareness)?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAny specific verticals or business types?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eStep 3: Let Claude Research and Build\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eClaude will research methodologies from top performance marketers and draft a comprehensive markdown file. This file includes:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBest practices from industry leaders\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSpecific trigger words that tell Claude when to use this skill\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDetailed methodologies and frameworks\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePlatform-specific insights\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eInstalling Skills in Claude\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eOnce Claude creates your skill file, you need to install it:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003col\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eGo to Settings in Claude\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNavigate to Capabilities\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFind the Skills section\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eUpload your skill file (it will be in the folder you specified)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eEnsure the skill is enabled\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eSkills in Action\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eOnce installed, your skills work automatically. When you ask Claude to \\"create a performance marketing brief for new Meta ads,\\" it will:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003col\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRecognize the trigger words (Meta ads, performance marketing)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAutomatically load your performance marketing skill\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eApply all the best practices and methodologies from that skill\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCreate a comprehensive brief informed by industry expertise\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe skill appears in Claude's response, showing you it's been activated and is informing the output.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe Power of Skill Stacking\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSkills become exponentially more powerful when combined. You can create skills for:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePerformance marketing\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eEmail marketing\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eContent strategy\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCopywriting\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAnalytics and reporting\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhen you ask for a \\"complete product launch campaign,\\" Claude can pull from multiple skills simultaneously, giving you strategies that incorporate best practices from specialists across all these areas.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eTwo Ways to Add Skills\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMethod 1: File Upload (Recommended)\\u003c/strong\\u003e Have Claude create the skill file, then upload it through the Skills interface. This method keeps everything organized and properly formatted.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMethod 2: Copy and Paste\\u003c/strong\\u003e You can also manually add skill instructions directly in the Skills interface by copying and pasting the content. This works well for simpler skills or when sharing skills created by others.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eMaking Skills Work for Your Business\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe most effective skills are specific to your actual work patterns. Consider creating skills for:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIndustries you work with frequently\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSpecific campaign types you run regularly\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCompliance requirements for your sector\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBrand voice and messaging guidelines\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAnalytics frameworks you use consistently\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eEach skill should contain enough detail to guide Claude's responses but remain flexible enough to apply across different projects.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eKey Takeaways\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSkills are reusable expertise\\u003c/strong\\u003e: They store best practices from industry leaders so Claude can apply them automatically to your work\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eClaude can create skills for you\\u003c/strong\\u003e: No need to manually research and write them yourself\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSkills activate automatically\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Trigger words tell Claude when to pull in specific skills\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSkill stacking multiplies power\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Combine multiple skills for comprehensive, expert-level outputs across different marketing functions\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTwo installation methods available\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Upload files for complex skills, or copy-paste for simpler ones\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7:[[\\"$\\",\\"$L12\\",null,\{\}],[\\"$\\",\\"main\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"min-h-screen pt-24 pb-20 px-6\\",\\"children\\":[\\"$\\",\\"article\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\\",\\"children\\":[[\\"$\\",\\"nav\\",null,\{\\"className\\":\\"mb-8\\",\\"children\\":[[\\"$\\",\\"$L5\\",null,\{\\"href\\":\\"/courses\\",\\"className\\":\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors\\",\\"children\\":\\"
